# Playwright MCP
.playwright-mcp/

# Agent/tooling scratch dirs. `.sisyphus/` was committed historically
# (root, backend/ and frontend/) and had to be removed from git history;
# ignore it everywhere so it cannot come back.
.sisyphus/

# Generated at Docker/packaging build time — never committed
backend/app/_build_info.py
# Staged from the repo-root VERSION at build time so setuptools' dynamic
# version resolves (see packaging/Makefile _build-venv). Root VERSION is
# the source of truth; this copy is build-only.
backend/VERSION

# Where the bundled action pack used to be fetched to. Nothing reads it
# any more and an old checkout can delete it; ignored so it doesn't show
# up as untracked in the meantime.
backend/app/ansible/

# Maintainer's local working notes — design drafts, exploratory
# scaffolding, multi-agent plan docs. Public-facing roadmap and bug
# registry live at TODO.md and BUGS.md at the repo root. See
# CONTRIBUTING.md (`plans/` is local-only) for the policy.
#/plans/
